==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*6 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**12 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Cala Maria]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Boraphim]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Research [[Ramen Cat]] and [[Sanzo Cat]] destroy this entire stage. Add [[Can Can Cat]] to gain a quick supply of money from the Heavenly Hippoes.

